  "title": "Grilled Whole Turkey",
  "description": "This grilled whole turkey is tender, juicy, and delicious! And it frees up your oven for all the tasty sides you&#39;ll need to cook for Thanksgiving.",
  "authors": [
    "Rtarver"
  ],
